    {
      "id": "claim_ef85384a1c6b443ea075af4fe3460741",
      "statement": "AppSettings is a flat struct of serde-default sub-settings (appearance, proxy, power, scheduler, download, bt, logging, aria2_rpc, cdn_acceleration, url_rewrite, io_baseline and more), so a partial or hand-edited settings.json still loads and unknown keys are ignored.",
