    {
      "id": "claim_0b328415e76643afbfd9f3a5ebc7de34",
      "statement": "Aria2RpcSettings carries enabled (default false), port (default 6800), listen_address (default 127.0.0.1), an optional secret, auth_mode, clients, cors_allowed_origins, allow_any_origin (default false) and exit_on_shutdown (default false); Aria2AuthMode defaults to single and Aria2Client stores an Argon2id token_hash, never the plaintext token.",
